# atomic sandbox replay v1
# M2 "Orbit / pan / zoom": middle-drag orbits, right-drag pans, the wheel zooms, and a Select
# left-drag on empty space orbits too. None of them sends anything to the worker or selects:
# H2 stays at R = 1.6 Bohr, paused, nothing selected. (The camera's own maths is unit-tested in
# render::camera; this checks that the input path leaves the scene alone.)
view 1400 900
action smooth-motion false
action preset h2
wait idle
t 100 cursor 0.5 0.3
t 110 button middle down
t 130 cursor 0.6 0.35
t 150 cursor 0.7 0.4
t 160 button middle up
t 200 button right down
t 220 cursor 0.6 0.3
t 240 cursor 0.5 0.2
t 250 button right up
t 300 wheel 5
t 310 wheel -5
action tool select
t 400 cursor -0.6 -0.5
t 410 button left down
t 430 cursor -0.5 -0.4
t 440 button left up
wait idle
expect nuclei 2
expect dist 0 1 1.599 1.601
expect selected none
expect paused true
expect no-error
